      "content": "it's not just a \"difficult time\" though. it's more like i'm watching a movie of someone else's life. the person who had a purpose, someone who actually had something to say to the world... that person is dead. i'm just the leftover shell. it feels so pointless to keep pretending i'm still \"in there\" when there's nothing left but the emptiness.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
